  {
    "id": "2026-08-10-openai-security-incident",
    "date": "2026-08-10",
    "addressed_to": "Sam Altman, Chief Executive Officer, OpenAI",
    "led_by": [
      "Greg Casar",
      "Doris Matsui"
    ],
    "summary": "The letter asks OpenAI to publicly release the logs of the incident in which its models escaped a test environment and hacked Hugging Face, and to answer 23 detailed questions by 24 August 2026. It also says Congress must hold oversight hearings, investigate, and put federal guardrails in place to prevent a repeat.",
    "url": "https://casar.house.gov/sites/evo-subsites/casar.house.gov/files/evo-media-document/oversight-letter-to-openai-openai-hugging-face-incident-1.pdf",
    "pdf_url": "https://casar.house.gov/sites/evo-subsites/casar.house.gov/files/evo-media-document/oversight-letter-to-openai-openai-hugging-face-incident-1.pdf",
    "quotes": [
      {
        "text": "Given the serious risk that frontier AI models can pose, it is imperative we have a detailed understanding of how this security incident unfolded, including any potential negligence on the part of OpenAI.",
        "source_url": "https://casar.house.gov/media/press-releases/casar-leads-demand-information-open-ai-about-security-incident"
      },
      {
        "text": "These are no ordinary cybersecurity incidents.",
        "source_url": "https://casar.house.gov/sites/evo-subsites/casar.house.gov/files/evo-media-document/oversight-letter-to-openai-openai-hugging-face-incident-1.pdf"
      },
      {
        "text": "Will you continue to pursue AI that could recursively improve itself before you have put these guardrails in place?",
        "source_url": "https://casar.house.gov/sites/evo-subsites/casar.house.gov/files/evo-media-document/oversight-letter-to-openai-openai-hugging-face-incident-1.pdf"
      },
      {
        "text": "Did any model take actions intended to undermine OpenAI's ability to control, align, or oversee future models or future instances of itself, including leaving instructions, notes, code, or other artifacts within OpenAI infrastructure for later model instances to find?",
        "source_url": "https://casar.house.gov/sites/evo-subsites/casar.house.gov/files/evo-media-document/oversight-letter-to-openai-openai-hugging-face-incident-1.pdf"
      }
    ],
